stalgie is a line of cooking systems that combines cutting-edge technology with sophisticated retro aesthetic inspiration.</p><p></p><ul><li>Indicator of residual heat</li><li>Automatic stop timer</li><li>Bridge monitoring</li><li>Booster function</li><li>Slide controls</li><li>Child safety</li><li>Protection from liquid spills and overheating</li><li>Precise electronic temperature regulation</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Indicator of Remaining Heat</strong></p><p>Indicates that the glass is hot, so care should be taken when handling it and putting objects on it to prevent damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Automatic Stop Timer</strong></p><p>Once the predetermined amount of time has passed, the active zone is turned off.</p><p></p><p><strong>Booster Function</strong></p><p>Enables you to concentrate all of the induction cooktop's (hob's) power in the designated zone to shorten boiling and cooking times.</p><p></p><p><strong>Slide Controls</strong></p><p>With the help of this practical \\\"touch control\\\" system, you can, for instance, change the operating temperature by moving your finger from right to left or vice versa.</p><p></p><p><strong>Child Safety</strong></p><p>The induction cooktop (hob) does not turn on by turning on the controls once this function has been set and until it is disabled.</p><p></p><p><strong>Liquid Spill Protection and Overheating</strong></p><p>A safety device trips and stops operation if the cooktop (hob) overheats or spills liquid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Limited 2-Year Parts and Labor Warranty</strong></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Proposition 65 in California</strong></p><p>WARNING: Cancer and Reproductive Harm</p><p><a href=\\\"/cdn/shop/files/.\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">P65Warnings.ca.gov</a></p></div> <div><div></div></div><br/><br/><strong>Freight Charges May Apply</strong><br/><br/></div></div> </div> <h3 class=\\\"station-tabs-tabtitle\\\"><span aria-controls=\\\"station-tabs-tabpanel_features\\\" aria-selected=\\\"fal