 Rangetop with Six Elements in Stainless Steel</strong></p><p>Technology and performance have an irresistible allure.</p><p></p><p>The symbol of Professional Plus is AISI304 steel, the superior raw material used in the finest restaurants' kitchens. A complete set of range cookers, cooktops (hobs), and hoods to create and enjoy optimal kitchen performance Aesthetics that are suited to the home's space and reflect the highest level of professionalism.</p><p></p><ul><li>Indicator of residual heat</li><li>Automatic stop timer</li><li>Bridge monitoring</li><li>Booster function</li><li>Slide controls</li><li>Child safety</li><li>Protection from liquid spills and overheating</li><li>Precise electronic temperature regulation</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Indicator of Remaining Heat</strong></p><p>Indicates that the glass is hot, so care should be taken when handling it and putting objects on it to prevent damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Automatic Stop Timer</strong></p><p>Once the predetermined amount of time has passed, the active zone is turned off.</p><p></p><p><strong>Booster Function</strong></p><p>Enables you to concentrate all of the induction cooktop's (hob's) power in the designated zone to shorten boiling and cooking times.</p><p></p><p><strong>Slide Controls</strong></p><p>With the help of this practical \\\"touch control\\\" system, you can, for instance, change the operating temperature by moving your finger from right to left or vice versa.</p><p></p><p><strong>Child Safety</strong></p><p>The induction cooktop (hob) does not turn on by turning on the controls once this function has been set and until it is disabled.</p><p></p><p><strong>Liquid Spill Protection and Overheating</strong></p><p>A safety device trips and stops operation if the cooktop (hob) overheats or spills liquid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Limited 2-Year Parts and Labor Warranty</strong></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Proposition 65 in California</strong></p><p>WARNING: Cancer and Reproductive Harm</p><p><a 